				<div class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 300px;"></div>				<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/a71857f9f0275181c24c7dae9fc05a1d.poster.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=500 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/a71857f9f0275181c24c7dae9fc05a1d.webm?t=1793197285" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/a71857f9f0275181c24c7dae9fc05a1d.mp4?t=1793197285" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >In this mix of <strong>Tower Defense, RTS, and Roguelite</strong> progression, you fight for your tribe's survival. The <strong>Imperium Aeternum</strong>, a massive shadow empire, sends its legions to erase the North and silence its gods.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >From the <strong>Spiridun</strong>, the divine nexus of your forefathers, command your last defense: build <strong>towers </strong>and rally <strong>warriors</strong>. Hold the line against endless waves, then strike back to reclaim your lands.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Each battle is a <strong>divine trial</strong>. As you fall and rise, ancient <strong>runestones </strong>awaken forgotten powers, reshaping your strategy with every run. Win the gods favor in the dawn of a new age: the <strong>Dawn of Defense</strong>.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/7ac2a6045343d4def13b156122fa4af7.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/e064ae6908915d91181f5bae3d3f19d8.poster.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=350 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/e064ae6908915d91181f5bae3d3f19d8.webm?t=1793197285" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/e064ae6908915d91181f5bae3d3f19d8.mp4?t=1793197285" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Your homeland withers under the Empire’s grip. Strike back against their strongholds, reclaim lost lands, and restore your tribe’s dominion.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/aba70197395a2cd417f326af4695b92f.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/d977f9f62556d5e136cacfd2d88ff9aa.poster.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=350 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/d977f9f62556d5e136cacfd2d88ff9aa.webm?t=1793197285" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/d977f9f62556d5e136cacfd2d88ff9aa.mp4?t=1793197285" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Battle enemies on two fronts: Defend yourself with towers and troops against enemy waves surging through the trenches, then command heroes and warriors in RTS sieges to capture new islands and enemy strongholds. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/b39d088ddb6425110bfe9e2f9300a211.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/29349a5f151a8559d3ffd897d939dd6c.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=350 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Summon your tribe's mightiest heroes to lead your forces into battle. Each hero brings unique abilities and powers, allowing you to shape the course of battle. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/5340906c0410ede4adae038b6ecc68f8.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/a88e16a2ab66728019c8c4daa94cea77.poster.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=350 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/a88e16a2ab66728019c8c4daa94cea77.webm?t=1793197285" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/a88e16a2ab66728019c8c4daa94cea77.mp4?t=1793197285" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every captured isle becomes a foothold for your people. Raise towers, rally warriors, claim strategy resources and build an economy to sustain your defenses against the Empire's forces.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/ae938b21b35c4255a4c0075d29214319.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/d8f6a5fa180b4bc38c5331bfcce88b6f.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=350 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Face Empire warlords who challenge your defenses with unique tactics. With each run, uncover their identity, learn their patterns, and adapt your strategy to claim victory.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/2fccae5828cfb00ba2a4870890d19f2d.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/fca62b0f315dc5f6e9baa5f4a74608c6.poster.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=350 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/fca62b0f315dc5f6e9baa5f4a74608c6.webm?t=1793197285" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/fca62b0f315dc5f6e9baa5f4a74608c6.mp4?t=1793197285" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Uncover the powers of ancient runestones and unlock upgrades for towers, warriors and economy, forging new strategies with every battle. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/602afab9ae616f0233f537ee6ddbb6c6.avif?t=1793197285" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Each battle sharpens your tactics, unlocks new tools, and prepares you for greater challenges ahead. Rise stronger and stand ready to face the Empire’s assault.</p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
